17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442105 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186442106 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186491195 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186525012 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186527137 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1039 "Finding Part of a Number Given a Whole and a Percentage Greater Than 100%" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186147250 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147595 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "176069e4-4aa3-58cd-a04e-a70e7e5da960" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186148561 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186148562 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186148563 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186148564 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045463 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1045 "Finding Part of a Number Given a Whole and a Percentage: Word Problems" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186148561 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186049467 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1050 420.0 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186147655 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "ce8303ff-2050-5cb3-8c68-076feb3951ea" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148561 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186148562 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148561 #edb/ref 1061 7956 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148561 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6f30bc9e-6f94-5aa2-a2a2-62ed9c078df2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148561 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186148699 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148562 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186148563 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148562 #edb/ref 1061 7957 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148562 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "6d044eff-fad0-5933-9034-a4181e67deeb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148562 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186147593 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148563 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186148564 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148563 #edb/ref 1061 7959 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148563 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "61efc867-f64d-544b-ba1c-5cfc49f6333b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148563 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186147594 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148564 #edb/ref 1061 7960 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148564 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "55dcb5aa-7569-519c-a7c0-b114e3d83f67" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148564 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186147595 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148699 #edb/ref 1064 "Percentages are *very* common in everyday life. For example, they are used in retail, finance, and sports! In this lesson, we will learn how to calculate the percentage of a whole number in real-world situations.\n\nFor example, suppose Daniel and Luisa traveled $200$ kilometers in their car. If Luisa drove $40 \\%$ of the way, how many kilometers did she drive?\n\nTo solve this problem, we can use the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\textrm{part} = \\textrm{percentage} \\times \\textrm{whole}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the whole is the number of kilometers traveled, which is $200$ kilometers. The percentage is $40 \\%,$ and the part is the distance Luisa drove.\n\nAs usual, we can use two methods to solve this problem:\n\n**Method 1**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a decimal: \n\n$$\n40 \\% = 40 \\div 100  = 0.4\n$$\n\nApplying our formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =40%\\times 200 \\\\  & =0.4\\times 200 \\\\  & =80.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo Luisa drove $80$ kilometers.\n\n**Method 2**\n\nFirst, we convert the percentage to a fraction:\n\n$$\n40 \\% = \\dfrac{40}{100} = \\dfrac{40 \\div 20}{100 \\div 20} = \\dfrac{2}{5}\n$$\n\nApplying the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{part} & =\\text{percentage}\\times \\text{whole} \\\\  & =40%\\times 200 \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}\\times 200 \\\\  & =\\frac{400}{5} \\\\  & =80.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAgain, we find that Luisa drove $80$ kilometers." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148699 #edb/ref 1065 2080 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148699 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "b32fe964-00bc-58b8-8e13-0ebde913bd87" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186148699 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151727 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186151728 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151727 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186151729 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151727 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186151730 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151727 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186151731 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151727 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186151732 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151727 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151727 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151727 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186151731 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151727 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "e7ddc8fa-ba31-589c-9917-aee0dc71b65e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151728 #edb/ref 1080 "II only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151728 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151728 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9670980d-0c33-5120-a8ae-e23cf2dd27d8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151729 #edb/ref 1080 "I, II, and III" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151729 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151729 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "b302849a-eda8-5c71-b37c-efab8f9fb26e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151730 #edb/ref 1080 "III only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151730 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151730 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e5cfffb3-0174-533c-96f5-9f587474d935" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151731 #edb/ref 1080 "I and II only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151731 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151731 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "eacca51c-b53a-5e95-aff5-f97957308643" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151732 #edb/ref 1080 "I only" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151732 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186151732 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "44525daf-0489-5c87-96c1-14f06cd29ce5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152124 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186049429 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152124 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186152399 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152124 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186152871 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152124 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186515579 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152124 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186521562 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152124 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186523984 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152124 #edb/ref 1039 "Classifying Numbers as Natural" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152124 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186151859 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152124 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "f0075774-6bd8-54c9-b698-4aacd499fce5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152125 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186152400 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152125 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186152870 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152125 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186433609 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152125 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186433610 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152125 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186524970 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152125 #edb/ref 1039 "Classifying Numbers as Integers" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152125 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186151860 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152125 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "ebf3f930-2768-5399-8470-48ac430065a3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152126 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186152877 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186152126 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/re